    "created_at": "2017-06-15T19:39:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-15T19:39:59Z",
    "body": "I think it should be \"rooted at the form element's owner document\". The \"rooted at the Document node\" instances in the current spec are actually about properties of the `Document` interface, so that's why they can say \"_the_ Document node\".",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
